{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46833","headline":"送李评事往宜春 · 齐己","name":"送李评事往宜春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰舟西去是通津，名郡贤侯下礼频。\n山遍寺楼看仰岫，台连城阁上宜春。\n鸿心夜过乡心乱，雪韵朝飞句韵新。\n别有官荣身外趣，月江松径访禅人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}